description:
Direct trains leaving in the next 90 minutes between two stations in Ireland (Irish Rail Intercity, Commuter, DART, Enterprise to Belfast): departure and arrival times, live delay, where the train is now. Live data only: no later days, no transfers.
Use when: someone wants to take a train in Ireland now or soon (e.g. Dublin to Cork).
Example: {"from":"Dublin Heuston","to":"Cork"}
